  "description": "Add two non-negative integers stored in reverse order as linked lists and return the sum as a linked list.",
  "pseudocode": "function addTwoNumbers(l1, l2):\n  dummy = new ListNode(0)\n  curr = dummy, carry = 0\n  while l1 != null or l2 != null or carry != 0:\n    v1 = l1 ? l1.val : 0\n    v2 = l2 ? l2.val : 0\n    sum = v1 + v2 + carry\n    carry = Math.floor(sum / 10)\n    curr.next = new ListNode(sum % 10)\n    curr = curr.next\n    l1 = l1 ? l1.next : null\n    l2 = l2 ? l2.next : null\n  return dummy.next",
